    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nCountry living with Dublin on your doorstep - the best of both worlds! Tucked away nicely, just off the Kiltipper Road Kiltipper Road, this fine three-bedroom detached home comes to the market in good condition throughout and sits on approx. 0.29 acres - ideal for further development (subject to FPP). A shared electric rolling gate opens onto a large site that comprises of a neighbours property to the right, with this property and plot located to the left, where there is ample parking both to the front and side of this dromer bungalow. The residence also has a wooden cabin to the left, which would need substantial repair or removal.The accommodation briefly comprises; entrance hallway, living room, kitchen/dining area, three bedrooms (main ensuite) and family bathroom. Ideally located less than a five minute walk from Old Bawn Shopping Centre, some nearby amenities include Tallaght Village, The Square Shopping Centre, Tallaght Hospital and many more amenities such as Gyms, cafes, restaurants and pubs. There are also beautiful walking trails from the top of the Kiltipper Road tha take you through the Dublin Mountains.This is a fantastic opportunity to finally trade the hustle and bustle for the quiet life and the setting you deserve.Call or email for viewing details."
      },
